Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:40.91,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.13,0:22:36.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（北23号公路）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.03,0:22:50.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马萨诸塞州）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.51,0:22:51.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德克萨斯州）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.39,0:00:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.65,0:00:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在外面碰见了他 只有他一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met him outside. He's by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿走了他的武器和装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took his weapons and we took his gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said he had a weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There something you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在附近有营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a camp nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.78,0:01:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要我们去面试加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to audition for membership.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望能用个别的词\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish there was another word.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,面试让我们听起来像是个舞蹈团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Audition makes it sound like we're some kind of a dance troupe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只在周五晚上跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's only on Friday nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.57,0:01:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且那不是营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, and it's not a camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.58,0:01:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a community.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.71,0:02:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你们都会成为很有价值的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you all would make valuable additions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这轮不到我来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的任务就是说服你们跟我回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job is to convince you all to follow me back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你 我也不会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you, I wouldn't go either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.90,0:02:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我知道我去的是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until I knew exactly what I was getting into.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.37,0:02:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨沙 你能把我的包给瑞克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha, can you hand Rick my pack?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面的口袋里有个信封\N{\fnArial\fs30}Front pocket, there's an envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,光靠嘴上说我们的社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way I could convince you to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没法说服你们跟我走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}just by talking about our community.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.38,0:02:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我带来了那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I brought those.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片很不清楚 我提前道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize in advance for the picture quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们刚发现旧相机店… - 没人在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We just found an old camera store last… - Nobody gives a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.91,0:02:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的太对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're absolutely 100% right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我想给你们看的第一张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the first picture I wanted to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我说的社区的一切情况都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}because nothing I say about our community will matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们知道那里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you know you'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.53,0:03:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你加入我们 你会很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you join us, you will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.31,0:03:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那面墙的每块板子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each panel in that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是长达15英尺 宽达12英尺的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a 15-foot-high, 12-foot-wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱氧钢板\N{\fnArial\fs30}slab of solid steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,框架是冷轧钢梁和方形管\N{\fnArial\fs30}framed by cold-rolled steel beams and square tubing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.92,0:03:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我们的允许 活人或行尸都无法进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing alive or dead gets through that without our say-so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我所说 安全显然很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, security is obviously important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 只有一项资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, there's only one resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.85,0:03:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们社区的生存而言更加重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}more critical to our community's survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.67,0:03:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同心协力 十分强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together we're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能让我们更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make us even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一张照片是门里的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next picture, you'll see inside the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的社区建于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our community was first construc…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的表情并不是说「我们攻击这人吧」\N{\fnArial\fs30}that look wasn't a "Let's attack that man" look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是「在我看来他这个人不错」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a "He seems like an okay guy to me" look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得绑住他 清空他的包\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to secure him. Dump his pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.23,0:04:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看他到底是个什么样的人 - 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's see what this guy really is. - Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余人 我们需要眼观六路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody else, we need eyes in every direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来找我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道他们如何来 何时来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might not know how or when,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们一定会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和萨沙开始没看见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sasha, we didn't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他想伤害我们早就下手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he had wanted to hurt us, he could've.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人发现什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.47,0:05:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏身之地太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a lot of places to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没见过这种枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen a gun like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那记右交叉拳真厉害 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a hell of a right cross there, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,扶他坐起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.55,0:05:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得最好… - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think it's better if… - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.51,0:05:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事 扶他坐起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine. Sit him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小心谨慎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:05:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I completely understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of your people are out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.67,0:06:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一把信号枪 可以向同伙发信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a flare gun. You have it to signal your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of them are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这重要吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does it matter? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.96,0:06:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了多少人 这的确很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}it matters how many people are actually out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 就算我说了人数又能怎样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but does it matter how many people I tell you are out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我敢肯定 不管我说多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm pretty sure no matter what number I say…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.71,0:06:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,8个\N{\fnArial\fs30}eight,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,32个\N{\fnArial\fs30}32,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.91,0:06:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,444个\N{\fnArial\fs30}444,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}zero…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我说什么 你都不会信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what I say, you're not going to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,脸上被打了一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's hard to trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还笑得出来的人的确很难信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}who smiles after getting punched in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那在路上给你们留下水的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a guy who leaves bottles of water for you in the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:06:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们跟踪我们多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you people been following us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:07:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间长到发现了你们基本上无视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough to see that you practically ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.75,0:07:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,身后跟着一群行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}a pack of roamers on your trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,长到发现了虽然你们没有食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough to see that despite a lack of food and water,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也没有攻击彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never turned on each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你们是有人性的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我所说 我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, and I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再说一次时你不要打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't punch me for saying it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,人是世界上最重要的资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is the most important resource in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many others are out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你不会信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you wouldn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果言语和照片说服不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's not words, if it's not pictures,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么才能相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}what would it take to convince you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:07:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this is for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我开车带你们去社区呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I drove you to the community?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.52,0:08:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在走 中午就能到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave now, we'll get there by lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定我们15个人怎么坐得下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure how the 15 of us are going to fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你那个朋友开来的那辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the car you and your one friend drove down here in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开了两辆车 如果我们发现了一队人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We drove separately. If we found a group,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望能把他们都带回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}we wanted to be able to bring them all home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都可以坐得下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's enough room for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,车就停在几英里外 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're parked just a couple miles away, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,山脊路东边 刚下16号公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}East on Ridge Road, just after you hit Route 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想停得更近 但是暴风雨来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted to get them closer, but then the storm came,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,堵塞了道路 我们没办法清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}blocked the road. We couldn't clear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你编得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you've really thought this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 如果我想埋伏你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, if I wanted to ambush you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.89,0:08:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就袭击这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁你们睡觉时点燃谷仓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, light the barn on fire while you slept,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们从唯一的出口跑出时射杀你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}pick you off as you ran out the only exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:09:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check out the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么车\N{\fnArial\fs30}There aren't any cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个方法能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们没必要知道 - 有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't need to find out. - We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有自己的想法 你很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you know and you're sure of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样做很危险 还是听我的保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your way is dangerous, mine isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.82,0:09:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道有好地方我们偏不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passing up someplace where we can live?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.51,0:09:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不让朱迪斯去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where Judith can live?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.07,0:09:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才真的是危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须一探究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find out what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can handle ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.03,0:09:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们一定要去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.23,0:09:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我陪他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll walk with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.57,0:10:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.91,0:10:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如有不测 弹药充足吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's trouble, you got enough firepower?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就剩下手里这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.41,0:10:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对讲机没电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walkies are out of juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你们一小时后还没回来 我们就去支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're not back in 60 minutes, we'll come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定这样恰好中了别人的圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which might be just what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们聚在一处 就是活靶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're all in here, we're a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the area covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.63,0:10:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 两人一组 在附近隐蔽起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, groups of two, find somewhere safe within eyeshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在世界还没乱套前\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the world was still the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为非政府组织工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked for an NGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.81,0:11:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务是往尼日尔河三角洲地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mission was to deliver medicine and food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,运送药品和食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Niger River Delta.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人隔三差五就想取我性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad people pointed guns in my face every other week.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.94,0:11:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也绝不会杀你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are definitely not going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because we're good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不代表就不会杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean we won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他们五人一小时后还没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the five of them aren't back in an hour…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就一刀捅穿你的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put a knife in the base of your skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.53,0:11:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位提高警惕 武器准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes open, everybody. Weapons up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.43,0:11:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦有人靠近就开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see someone coming at us, you fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.61,0:11:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.39,0:12:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要看到人就开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we see someone, we just shoot them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们跟我们一样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they're someone like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果亚伦说的是实话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if Aaron is telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们真的毫无恶意呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they're someone who has nothing to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.18,0:12:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们五个全副武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're five people walking with guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.79,0:12:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会没事跑来问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's coming up to say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.65,0:12:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他就跑来问好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's exactly what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们跟我们一样 我们更应该感到害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's someone like us, we should be afraid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是说一直监视着我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was watching us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他昨天肯定看到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means he saw us yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然他知道我们做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after everything we've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.73,0:12:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么还想让我们加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would he want us to join his group?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们救了神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}People like us saved a priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.43,0:12:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了跟总督一起去监狱的那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saved a girl who rolled up up to the prison with the Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.39,0:12:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还救了拿刀的疯女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saved a crazy lady with a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:12:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.19,0:13:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不晓得他看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what he saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到我背包里的那瓶苹果酱了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did see the jar of applesauce in my bag, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.13,0:13:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想耍花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想借此让你对我有好感\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about trying to make you like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是自卫本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's self-preservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.35,0:13:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果行尸们循着哭声过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if the roamers hear her and come this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定先死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'll be the first to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会毒害你的女儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm trying to poison your baby daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被绑着 而你又决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tied up and you've already expressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要捅穿我的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}a willingness to stab me in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.45,0:14:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我残忍地杀了你的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would cruelly killing your daughter in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.95,0:14:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}in any way help the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她死不了 只是会生病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she doesn't die. Maybe she gets sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只有你能帮她 那我就输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're the only one that can help her and I just lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.13,0:14:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确只有我可以帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the only one who can help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.49,0:14:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我有苹果酱 这叫双赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I have applesauce and we all win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌苹果酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate applesauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈常逼我吃我讨厌的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom used to make me eat foods.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吃了就能变得更爷们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't like to make me more manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲑鱼肉饼 苹果酱 洋葱之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salmon patties, applesauce, and onions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.85,0:14:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她那时很迷惑 尽了最大的努力改变我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a very confused woman who tried her damndest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带来苹果酱是想表明我们那有苹果树\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just bring the jar to show that we have apple trees nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.18,0:14:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你说的 要死也你先死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you said, you'll be the first to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个社区足够大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The community is big enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以给你找到安身之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can find a place for you to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.30,0:15:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使她哭闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}where even when she cries, no one,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会传到墙外\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing can hear it outside the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有43分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got 43 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我站住 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one step closer, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.87,0:16:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.07,0:16:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.57,0:16:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的个乖乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gracious Ignatius.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久没吃过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it has been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过雷克斯一晚上吃了三罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I saw Rex eat three cans one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,四罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那混蛋知道如果他不丢过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch knew if he didn't toss 'em back,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.42,0:17:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要去抢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have come for 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在消防车那会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at the fire truck,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打了尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}after Eugene…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.18,0:17:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是以为我也会打你\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you think I was gonna hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.23,0:17:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时你不理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.13,0:18:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些 现在是我们的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, this is ours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我们去不去你的营地 这些都归我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ours whether or not we go to your camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 我们为什么不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? Why wouldn't we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he were lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者想伤害我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if he wanted to hurt us…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他没撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.99,0:18:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有伤害我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.59,0:18:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们全都要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're going, all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.14,0:18:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人有不同意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody say something if they feel differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个谷仓一股子马粪味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This barn smells like horse shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们往哪走 你的营地在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where are we going? Where's your camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次带新成员回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, every time I've done this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.39,0:19:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是由我来驾车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been behind the wheel driving recruits back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you're good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.93,0:19:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此我敢赌上性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've bet my life on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是还不敢赌上我朋友们的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just not ready to bet my friends' lives just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能驾车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想回家 就说出路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you want to get home, you'll have to tell us how.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,向北走16号公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go north on Route 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了我再告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们向北走23号公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take 23 north.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那里以后你再给我们指路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll give us directions from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…我不知道还能怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's… I don't know how else to say it…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.17,0:19:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个糟糕的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们清理了16号公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've cleared 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,走那里更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走23号公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.03,0:19:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们日落时出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave at sundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:19:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走夜路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing this at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道这很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.23,0:20:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要比白天开到他们门前去好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's better than riding up to the gates during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.25,0:20:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有危险 我们就必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it isn't safe, we need to get gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们察觉之前离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they know we're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会伤害你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想保护你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to protect your group,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实是置他们于危险之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're putting them in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.60,0:20:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我营地在哪 我们现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where the camp is, we'll leave right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚肯定很漫长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be a long night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.09,0:20:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,能休息就休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some rest if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 你 我和格伦开车带他一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking you, me, and Glenn drive with that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.61,0:21:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔和朱迪思坐在那辆车上更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl and Judith are safer in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说我们现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you said that we were going,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.70,0:21:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真心的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}was that for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.77,0:21:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说 你只想骗他说出营地在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you just trying to get this guy to tell you where his camp is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.72,0:21:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指不论付出什么代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能到就行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as long as we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一次靠近伍德伯里的外墙时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you first came up on the walls outside Woodbury…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.44,0:21:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,终点站呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Terminus?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.31,0:21:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.74,0:21:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚某时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometime tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.57,0:21:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会到他的营地墙边\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll be outside his camp's walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.94,0:21:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在看不到里面的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And without seeing inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.35,0:22:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须做出是否带家人进去的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to decide whether to bring my family in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.27,0:22:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他之前问过我 怎样我才会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked me before what it would take for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.83,0:22:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信他说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to believe it was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.67,0:22:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何东西能说服我走进那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure if anything could convince me to go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我要去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.17,0:22:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.78,0:22:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想集齐五十个州的车牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I'm trying to collect all 50 states.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.51,0:23:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,都钉在我家的墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put them all on a wall in my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有自己的房子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your own house?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以自己看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.27,0:23:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你没有你伙伴们的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you have any pictures of your people?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拍过一张全体人员照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I took a picture of the whole group,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.85,0:23:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是曝光出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't get the exposure right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.99,0:23:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我想洗出那张照片时 它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I tried to develop it later, it just…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.79,0:23:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问过他那些问题了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ask him the questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.85,0:23:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.25,0:23:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了多少行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many walkers have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.46,0:24:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.44,0:24:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 很多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.64,0:24:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.97,0:24:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.67,0:24:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.42,0:24:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.15,0:24:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你窃听了我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were listening to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.38,0:24:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我在监视你们 是的 我窃听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already said I was watching you. Yes, I was listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.51,0:24:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说他的同伙可能也有窃听器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means his people could have one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.92,0:24:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能已经听到我们的计划了 有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could've heard our plan. This isn't safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.73,0:24:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.38,0:24:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格伦 - 他们就在我们后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glenn! - They were right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.35,0:24:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能撞上我们 现在他们可以下车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would have hit us. Now they can get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.47,0:25:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.35,0:25:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们走了 他们脱身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're gone. They got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.70,0:25:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们折回去找他们 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll circle back and find them. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.81,0:25:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.65,0:25:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们上23号公路行驶几英里后往左拐\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we can take a left a couple of miles up 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.11,0:25:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到杰弗逊大道 - 杰弗逊大道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jefferson Avenue. - Jefferson Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.67,0:25:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.97,0:25:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.76,0:25:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.12,0:26:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.34,0:26:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,动啊 动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.38,0:26:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see what I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.37,0:26:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们冲着我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming right for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.75,0:26:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 我们知道 - 动啊 动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, we know. - Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.14,0:26:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.31,0:26:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.44,0:26:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.11,0:26:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.78,0:26:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 这件事结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to leave. This is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.72,0:26:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我出去 我必须走了 这件事结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out. I need to get outta here. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.67,0:26:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.16,0:26:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.69,0:26:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,米恩琼 别管他 我们得找到自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne, leave him! We need to find our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.51,0:26:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看到了信号弹 肯定以为是我们放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saw that flare. They'll think we shot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.13,0:26:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那边就能找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how we find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.64,0:27:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Glenn?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.37,0:28:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.93,0:28:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跑的话快跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.15,0:28:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有其他的事要担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got other things to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.48,0:28:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以一起活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.55,0:28:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有我们在一起才能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can only make it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.16,0:28:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你说的 我是在窃听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that. I was listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.57,0:28:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.95,0:28:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got to be somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.53,0:28:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.21,0:29:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想再把我绑起来 可以 但要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you really want to tie me up again, that's fine, but hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.50,0:29:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 我们走那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time. We're going that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.91,0:29:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.68,0:29:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.91,0:30:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是个陷阱 要把我们引回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is a trap to get us back where you want us,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.74,0:30:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的人今晚就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your people are going to die tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.82,0:30:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号弹是水塔那边放出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flare was towards the water tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.66,0:30:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.16,0:30:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你妹妹还好吗 - 没事 我们都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your sister okay? - Yeah. Yeah, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.54,0:30:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克 埃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric? Eric?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.53,0:30:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃里克 - 我在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eric? - In here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.86,0:30:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.69,0:30:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.17,0:31:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.33,0:31:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是运动伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a volleyball injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.04,0:31:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚踝骨折\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a broken ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.53,0:31:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少玛姬是这样说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least that's what Maggie said.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.13,0:31:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.44,0:31:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是大伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.39,0:31:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.53,0:31:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去以后我去医务室看看就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just go to the infirmary when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.82,0:31:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我看到信号弹时 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I saw that flare go up, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.85,0:31:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.53,0:31:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很担心我 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were worried, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.98,0:31:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.00,0:31:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的错 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your fault, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.84,0:31:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.78,0:31:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.96,0:31:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一担心就会做蠢事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because when I'm worried, I do stupid things.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.15,0:32:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一做蠢事就会藏到老破车底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I do stupid things, I wind up underneath a rust bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.88,0:32:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,被行尸包围着\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrounded by roamers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.97,0:32:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,左脚踝还被后轮压了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who roll a rear passenger tire onto my left ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.18,0:32:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天也有好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, something good came out of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.25,0:32:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等你的时候搜索了周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I was waiting for you, I searched through the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.84,0:32:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.62,0:32:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞丢了车牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost the license plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.00,0:32:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把车都搞丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.92,0:32:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这样更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.50,0:32:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话那车太难看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That monstrosity out front can run.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.78,0:32:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑得都能吓跑行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so ugly, it'll scare the roamers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.06,0:32:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是埃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.98,0:32:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.43,0:32:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.25,0:33:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,打搅一下 打搅一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.03,0:33:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.54,0:33:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们救了埃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.43,0:33:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你们所有人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you. All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.31,0:33:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会确保我们抵达社区以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will make sure that debt is paid in full.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.44,0:33:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全报答你们的恩情\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we get to our community.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.82,0:33:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们抵达亚历山大以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we get to Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.95,0:33:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我不知道你们怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm not sure about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.04,0:33:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我今晚不想再坐车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'd rather not do any more driving tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.68,0:33:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以明早再上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can hit the road tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.96,0:33:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.60,0:33:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果我们要在这里过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we're staying here for the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.94,0:33:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就必须睡那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're sleeping over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.85,0:34:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得有这个必要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think we got to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.17,0:34:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样保险点 我们又不了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the safe play. We don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.00,0:34:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你枪杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way you're gonna stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.28,0:34:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我一定要和他在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}me from being with him right now is by shooting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.47,0:34:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 他告诉我们营地的位置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, he told us where the camp is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.58,0:34:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他的同伴真的只有一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he really was only travelling with one other person.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.13,0:34:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都没有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're both unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.57,0:34:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个人脚踝还断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them's got a broken ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.09,0:34:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想让我们安全点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want us to be safe, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.78,0:34:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能放弃一切人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't give up everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.29,0:34:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我说过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.74,0:34:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是其实这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it does matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.59,0:35:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.77,0:35:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.90,0:35:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道该吃药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's time for another dose,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.38,0:35:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想让他一路睡到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I want to let him sleep until we get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.93,0:35:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.32,0:35:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是几瓶药 不用吝啬\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few bottles. Don't need to be stingy with 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.95,0:35:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那有多疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how bad those hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.45,0:35:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.52,0:35:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.98,0:35:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.86,0:35:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在灾变前伤的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did that happen before?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.23,0:35:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在灾变中伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}During.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.63,0:36:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸和我出了车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad and me, car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.66,0:36:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,路上有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rotters in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.78,0:36:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前有个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.28,0:36:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,能走路已经很幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably lucky I can even walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.11,0:36:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在亚历山大有一位很出色的外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a pretty gifted surgeon in Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.72,0:36:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.69,0:36:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过他妙手回春\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen him do some amazing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.87,0:36:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might be able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.85,0:36:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.85,0:36:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.62,0:36:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.41,0:36:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,七张桩牌 方格棋盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven-card stud. Stares and squares.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.47,0:36:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,大小顺序是A K Q J\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's aces, cuatros, neeners, and two-eyed jacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.82,0:36:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共14张外卡 你是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's 14 wild cards? Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.64,0:36:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟两只在交配的狗一样认真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serious as two copulating dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.67,0:37:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.10,0:37:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.95,0:37:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看路 壮汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes on the road, champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.82,0:37:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.91,0:37:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩不到一半路了 为什么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're a little over halfway there. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.29,0:37:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.97,0:37:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.19,0:37:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,做不到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.81,0:37:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟那辆救火车没两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might as well paint it red, put a ladder on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.82,0:37:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要换个电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need is another battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.31,0:38:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,上哪儿去找电池啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where in the hell are we gonna find another battery?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.99,0:38:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.00,0:38:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道那里有电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know those were there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.95,0:38:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.03,0:38:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fight's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.92,0:38:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须学会放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.65,0:38:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.09,0:38:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟生存欲曾令你\N{\fnArial\fs30}After it's kept you…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.34,0:38:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,温暖 饱餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}warm and fed and…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.05,0:38:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.65,0:38:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the fight…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.03,0:38:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,转变你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it turns on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.23,0:38:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.46,0:39:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃在教堂也对我说过这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Bob was trying to tell me back at the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.12,0:39:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,该冒什么险\N{\fnArial\fs30}What to risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.02,0:39:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,何时是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.48,0:39:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,何时该接纳他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When to let someone in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.31,0:39:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,规矩一直在变\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.10,0:39:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.97,0:39:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们走之前 我要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we get going, I got to…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.19,0:39:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去静静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to take a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.43,0:41:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.65,0:41:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.45,0:41:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.06,0:41:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.98,0:41:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though you were wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.60,0:42:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你那样做依然是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were still right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.43,0:42:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we go?
